{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54040","headline":"过水覩影大悟前旨因有偈（题拟） · 良价","name":"过水覩影大悟前旨因有偈（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"切忌从他觅，迢迢与我疎。\n我今独自往，处处得逢渠。\n渠今正是我，我今不是渠。\n应须与麽（《祖堂集》作「摩」，《五灯会元》、《悦心集》作「恁麽」）会，方始（前引三书作「得」）契如如。\n（同前。\n以《祖堂集》卷五、卷七、《五灯会元》卷十三、《悦心集》卷一所引相校。\n《悦心集》题作《水中覩影口占》。\n《五灯会元》卷七作《过水偈》，引疎、渠二韵）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"良价","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54040.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54040","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}